From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 14:45:02 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: apple: restore the J713 native radio port after
 system sleep

Rebuild the native port, GPIOs, requester/MSI routes and DART before PCI
resumes the BCM4388 functions. Keep endpoint bus mastering disabled
until the translation context is restored and the link and identities
agree.

Require both bound endpoint drivers to participate in the sleep
transaction. A refused sleep restores the retained link without
resetting it; a failed power-loss recovery stops before other DMA users
resume. Enable the J713 radio and publish its CLKREQ GPIO with the host
support. Add host lifecycle and register-failure fixtures.

Signed-off-by: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
Signed-off-by: Bartosz Nitka <niteria@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 58d4455d0dc7e7f9b031667dbc12a60274460fa8)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
